  ('8486100000', 'Band saws designed for cutting or slicing cylindrical monocrystalline silicon ingots (boules) of an initial mass exceeding 400 kg into square or rectangular ingots (boules), for use in solar wafer manufacturing (USTR exclusion, U.S. note 20(www)(2))', false),
